Package: amber-gtk4-dev
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Andre Bremer <hyperquader@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: amber-gtk4 (= @VERSION@), libglib2.0-dev, libpango1.0-dev, libcairo2-dev, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-dev, libgraphene-1.0-dev, libwayland-dev, libx11-dev
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Hyperquader-Coders/amber-gtk4
Description: GTK4 development files for the amber suite's bundle
 The headers, pkg-config files and unversioned library link of the
 amber-gtk4 bundle, all under /usr/lib/amber-gtk4, so they never meet
 the distro's libgtk-4-dev. The suite's Odin bindings are generated from
 these headers.
 .
 Build with PKG_CONFIG_PATH set to /usr/lib/amber-gtk4/pkgconfig, and give
 the program the RUNPATH /usr/lib/amber-gtk4.
